  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Employment Strategy II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to strengthen the Nigerian business climate for young and innovative start-ups and small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), through the creation of synergies and the fostering of connections between Nigerian &#x2013; and Dutch &#x2013;  start-ups and SMEs themselves, and through leveraging the power of the developed Youth Employment Strategy (YES) network.</narrative>
  </description>
